invariant: INV-44
file: p384_wide_field.c
catches: p384_equiv_test
reason: the plain subtraction returns its carry where its caller reads
  a borrow, so p384_wide_mod_sub adds the modulus back to every
  difference that did not borrow and to none that did.
  bin/p384_equiv_test requires the borrow and the difference to be
  p384_field.c's.

--- old
    return carry ^ 1;
--- new
    return carry;
